Z||000018||fierohoho||09-21-2001||04:32 AM||||Won't have a day off till Monday. <P>I plan on hitting the cities to do some shopping so I hope to pick up the crystals I can at the electronics surplus store. <P>I'll start with the next one up from the 4.194 that I took out.<P>Doesn't look like I'll need to go over the 8.00Mhz crystal for my 140 unit so that should be easy.<P>Are the crystals only made in certain freq's or can you get just about anything if you look around?<P>falconhulk, I will try to draw a schematic if I get a chance and post it, DO NOT hold your breath that it will be a work of art but I'll try. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
