Z||000029||fierohoho||10-16-2001||03:03 PM||||Well, today is the day I test the crystals.<P>I finally got the setup done for the easy swap and will try and post the results tonight.<P>I'll post some poor webcam pics of the stuff allong with the results.<P>It's been almost a month since I bought the crystals, thought I'd go nuts because I couldn't find em but they were in the last place I looked <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">.<P>Results tonight!!! HoHo||||reg||1
